## Bundled fonts

This app embeds two font families under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(OFL). The full OFL text for each family, copied verbatim from the
`@expo-google-fonts` package that ships it, is at:

- `assets/fonts/LICENSES/OFL-Inter.txt` — Inter. Copyright 2020 The Inter
  Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter).
- `assets/fonts/LICENSES/OFL-IBMPlexSansArabic.txt` — IBM Plex Sans Arabic.
  Copyright 2017 IBM Corp., with Reserved Font Name "Plex".

Only the static 400 (Regular) and 500 (Medium) weights of each family are
bundled. See `operations/specs/design_mobile_design_system_port/plan_phase_1.md`
(DES-P1-002, DES-P1-003) for why these two families were chosen.
